"{\"datasetId\": 11705369, \"datasetSlug\": \"student-exam-performance-and-success-dataset\", \"ownerUser\": \"mobeenfatimah\", \"usabilityRating\": 1.0, \"totalViews\": 10350, \"totalVotes\": 58, \"totalDownloads\": 3094, \"title\": \"Student Exam Performance &  Success Dataset\", \"subtitle\": \"100K student records with 44 features for exam score, Pass/fail prediction.\", \"description\": \"##  Overview\\n\\nThe **Student Exam Performance & Academic Success Dataset** is a large-scale, semi-synthetic dataset containing **100,000 student records** across **44 features**. \\n\\nUnlike purely random datasets, this dataset was engineered using non-linear physics and calibrated score standardization. It includes realistic interactions among student habits, socioeconomic backgrounds, study behaviors, and mental wellbeing, offering an ideal sandbox for machine learning modeling, data cleaning, and exploratory analysis.\\n\\n---\\n\\n##  Key Target Variables\\n\\nThis dataset supports multiple machine learning tasks with four distinct targets:\\n\\n* **`exam_score` (Numeric / Continuous):** Final score ranging from 0 to 100. Ideal for **Regression**.\\n* **`pass_status` (Binary / Categorical):** `Pass` (\\u226550) or `Fail` (<50). Ideal for **Binary Classification**.\\n* **`performance_grade` (Multi-Class Categorical):** Standard letter grades (`A`, `B`, `C`, `D`, `F`) based on a realistic academic distribution (~77% pass rate).\\n* **`performance_level` (Multi-Class Categorical):** Performance categories (`High`, `Medium`, `Low`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n##  Dataset Structure & Feature Domains\\n\\nThe 44 columns are categorized into 6 core operational domains:\\n\\n1. **Student Demographics:** `student_id`, `age`, `gender`, `education_level`, `school_type`, `family_income`, `parent_education`, `urban_rural`\\n2. **Academic Baseline:** `previous_exam_score`, `previous_gpa`, `attendance_percentage`, `assignment_completion_rate`, `class_participation`, `private_tuition`\\n3. **Study Habits & Behavior:** `study_hours_per_day`, `self_study_hours`, `study_consistency`, `study_environment`, `study_method`, `revision_frequency`, `practice_tests_completed`, `notes_quality`\\n4. **Lifestyle & Wellbeing:** `sleep_hours`, `sleep_quality`, `daily_screen_time`, `physical_activity_hours`, `break_frequency`, `stress_level`, `motivation_level`\\n5. **Technology & Exam Factors:** `internet_access`, `device_availability`, `educational_app_usage`, `online_course_hours`, `exam_difficulty`, `exam_preparation_days`, `questions_attempted`, `questions_correct`, `time_management_score`, `exam_anxiety_level`\\n6. **Engineered Targets:** `exam_score`, `performance_grade`, `pass_status`, `performance_level`\\n\\n---\\n\\n##  Recommended Use Cases\\n\\n* **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA):** Analyze how study consistency, sleep quality, and anxiety impact final scores.\\n* **Missing Value Imputation:** Practice imputing 5\\u201310% intentionally injected missing values across key columns (`previous_gpa`, `attendance_percentage`, `sleep_quality`, etc.).\\n* **Supervised Learning Models:** Train XGBoost, LightGBM, Random Forests, or Neural Networks for regression and classification.\\n* **Feature Importance & SHAP Analysis:** Identify key behavioral vs. demographic drivers of student success.\\n* **Early At-Risk Identification:** Build predictive algorithms to identify students at risk of failing (`Grade F`) before final exams.\\n\\n---\\n\\n##  Dataset Health & Diagnostics\\n\\n* **Total Records:** 100,000 unique students (No duplicates)\\n* **Overall Pass Rate:** ~77.4%\\n* **Grade Distribution:** Normal academic curve (`D`: ~34.8%, `C`: ~21.8%, `F`: ~22.6%, `B`: ~13.2%, `A`: ~7.5%)\\n* **Missing Values:** ~5\\u201310% missingness in selected columns for data-cleaning challenges.\\n\\n### Author\\n   **Mobeen Fatima** @mobeenfatimah\", \"keywords\": [\"universities and colleges\", \"education\", \"exploratory data analysis\", \"linear regression\", \"tabular\"], \"licenses\": [{\"name\": \"CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0\"}]}"